<title>USA: Health Care Property sets deals of $14.7 mln.</title>
<headline>Health Care Property sets deals of $14.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Health Care Property Investors Inc said Wednesday it had purchased three assisted-living facilities for $7.3 million and agreed to fund a $7.4 million assisted-living center.</p>
<p>The purchased facilities total were built in the past 12 months, have a total 138 units and are located in Lubbock, Conroe and Mesquite, Texas.</p>
<p>The funded project is a 117-unit facility located in Boise, Idaho.</p>
</text>
